          "Psalm 70"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer for Help against Persecutors."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the music director. A Psalm of David; for a memorial."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, hurry to save me;",
          "Lord, hurry to help me!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May those who seek my life",
          "Be put to shame and humiliated;",
          "May those who delight in my harm",
          "Be turned back and dishonored."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May those who say, “Aha, aha!” be turned back",
          "Because of their shame."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶May all who seek You rejoice and be glad in You;",
          "And may those who love Your salvation say continually,",
          "“May God be exalted!”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But I am afflicted and needy;",
          "Hurry to me, God!",
          "You are my help and my savior;",
          "Lord, do not delay."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
